//! DREAM condition-based refinement for ACYCLIC regions (NDSS 2015 §IV-B,
//! `research/papers/dream_ndss2015.txt`). Step 2 of the irreducible-structuring
//! plan (`docs/design-structurer-irreducible-2026-05-29.md`).
